               <title>Principal Display Panel</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Compare to active ingredients in Pepcid Complete<sup>®</sup>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Dual Action Acid Reducer + Antacid</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Famotidine 10 mg, Calcium Carbonate 800mg, Magnesium Hydroxide 165 mg</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Mint Flavor</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Tablets (Chewable)</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Acid Reducer + Antacid</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Just One Tablet Relieves Heartburn Due To Acid Indigestion</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>up&amp;up<sub>TM</sub>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Actual Size</paragraph>
